Viktor 10.10.2026: «Артиста по модели InvokeAI постарайся на максимум вывести со всем возможным ахуем».

The stage's «Compare…» waits for the other picture (its thumbnails get a dashed amber edge; Esc gives up); picked in the runs or the gallery, the two lie one over the other under a divider over the page, A left of it and B right (B clipped), each labelled with its shape, seed and time: the divider follows the pointer, ← and → move it by a fiftieth (Shift: a tenth); «Side by side» (S) lays them apart, «Swap» (X) changes them, Esc, ✕ or a click beside closes.

Suite: 561/0 in the kitchen; pictures of both ways by tools/claude-compare-probe.mjs (the outpainted cabin against its first painting).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
